PORT=XXXX
NEXT_PUBLIC_BACKEND_URL=http://localhost:XXXX

# ── Public landing page ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# What the public landing page shows. Comma-separated, in display order. Leave
# either line out and the full set shows.
#
# NEXT_PUBLIC_LANDING_MARKETS — ISO-3166-1 alpha-2 market codes. Drives the
# hero badge, the footer chips, the jurisdiction configurator, the market proof
# strip and the hero's market switcher. The profiles themselves live in
# `frontend/components/landing/data/landingData.ts` (a copy of
# `backend/src/prisma/jurisdictions.ts` — the frontend must not import backend
# source). An unknown code is dropped with a console warning and the rest still
# render.
#
# NEXT_PUBLIC_LANDING_CURRENCIES — ISO-4217 codes for the pricing currency
# switcher. One per currency the enabled markets bill in: Germany and France
# share the euro, so fourteen currencies cover fifteen markets. Leave the line
# out and the currencies the enabled markets bill in are used instead.
#
# NEXT_PUBLIC_* values are inlined at build time — change them and rebuild.
# NEXT_PUBLIC_LANDING_MARKETS=KE,ZA,US,GB,CA,AU,DE,FR,IN,CN,JP,KR,BR,MX,AE
# NEXT_PUBLIC_LANDING_CURRENCIES=USD,KES,ZAR,GBP,CAD,AUD,EUR,INR,CNY,JPY,KRW,BRL,MXN,AED

# ── Demo data seed ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Read by `npm run db:seed:demo` and `npx prisma db seed` only. Leave every one
# of them unset and the seed behaves exactly as before.
#
# NEXT_DEMO_COUNTRY — the *primary* market, by ISO-3166-1 alpha-2. It is the market
# that gets the two full demo organizations (Rohi with the whole dataset,
# Westhill as the starter). Every other market gets a market organization
# instead. Default: KE.
#
# NEXT_DEMO_COUNTRIES — the markets to seed, comma-separated ISO-3166-1 alpha-2
# codes. Leave empty to seed every supported market:
#   KE ZA US GB CA AU DE FR IN CN JP KR BR MX AE
# (Africa is Kenya and South Africa only.) An unknown code fails the seed
# loudly rather than being silently skipped.
#
# NEXT_DEMO_MODE=multi — additionally creates the "Global Properties International"
# organization with its London / New York / Nairobi / Dubai branches.
#
# NEXT_DEMO_COUNTRY=KE
# NEXT_DEMO_COUNTRIES=KE,ZA,US,GB,CA,AU,DE,FR,IN,CN,JP,KR,BR,MX,AE
# NEXT_DEMO_MODE=
